# Design Specification: "The SaaS Starting Point" Landing Page

## 1. Layout Breakdown

### Hero Section (100vh)
*   **Background**: `#F8FAFC` (Slate-50) with subtle grid (opacity 3-5%) and soft radial gradient (`radial-gradient(circle at 50% 0%, #E0E7FF 0%, transparent 40%)` - customized indigo-100).
*   **Desktop Split**:
    *   **Left (Content)**: Vertical stack. H1 -> Subtext -> Benefits -> Trust -> Badges. Max-width `65ch` (approx).
    *   **Right (Form)**: Center-aligned vertical or slightly offset. Elevated high-z-index card.
*   **Mobile**: Vertical stack. H1 -> Form Card -> Benefits. Padding `x-6`, `y-16`.

### "This is for you" Section
*   **Structure**: 3-column grid (desktop), 1-column stack (mobile).
*   **Cards**: Minimalist, white, border `slate-200`, subtle shadow.

### "What you'll get" Section
*   **Structure**: 2-column grid. Left: "Inside PDF", Right: "Cost/Value".
*   **Visuals**: Clear hierarchy, checkmarks for "Inside", minimal icons/text for "Cost".

### FAQ Section
*   **Structure**: Single column, max-width `600-700px` centered.
*   **Component**: Accordion. White background, thin borders.

## 2. Typography System
*   **Font Family**: `Golos Text` (Existing project font) or `Inter` if specified (sticking to `Golos Text` as per [layout.tsx](file:///Users/Office/Repos/Organisation/ProChat/Web/prochat/src/app/layout.tsx)).
*   **Scale**:
    *   **H1**: `clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 4rem)`, Weight 700-800, Color `#0F172A` (Slate-900), LH 1.1.
    *   **H2**: `text-3xl` md:`text-4xl`, Weight 700, Color `#0F172A`.
    *   **H3**: `text-lg` to `text-xl`, Weight 600, Color `#0F172A`.
    *   **Body/Subtext**:
        *   Hero Subtext: `18-20px` (`text-lg`), LH 1.6, `#475569` (Slate-600).
        *   Standard Body: `16px` (`text-base`), `#475569`.
    *   **Labels/Micro**: `text-sm` or `text-xs`, uppercase flexible tracking (`tracking-wide` or `0.08em`).

## 3. Spacing Scale
*   **Section Padding**: `py-24` (96px) to `py-32` (128px) for desktop; `py-16` (64px) for mobile.
*   **Component Padding**:
    *   Cards: `p-8` (32px).
    *   Inputs/Buttons: `h-14` (56px), `px-6`.
*   **Gap/Margins**:
    *   Hero Elements: `space-y-6` or `space-y-8`.
    *   Grid Gaps: `gap-8` (32px) or `gap-12`.

## 4. Color Usage Guide
*   **Backgrounds**:
    *   Page: `#F8FAFC` (Slate-50).
    *   Cards/Surfaces: `#FFFFFF` (White).
    *   Accents (Subtle): `#F1F5F9` (Slate-100) for hover/secondary.
*   **Text**:
    *   Primary (Headings): `#0F172A` (Slate-900).
    *   Secondary (Body): `#475569` (Slate-600).
    *   Tertiary (Label/Muted): `#64748B` (Slate-500).
*   **Brand/Action**:
    *   Primary CTA: `#4338CA` (Indigo-700). Gradient subtle for button `bg-gradient-to-br from-indigo-600 to-indigo-700`.
    *   Focus Rings: `ring-indigo-500` (Indigo-500).

## 5. Shadow System
*   **Level 1 (Cards/UI)**: `shadow-sm` or custom `0 4px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.04)`.
*   **Level 2 (Hero Form)**: `shadow-xl` or custom `0 20px 60px rgba(15,23,42,0.08)`.
*   **Interactive**: Hover lift + slight shadow expansion.

## 6. Component Structure
*   `StartPageLayout`: Main wrapper.
*   `HeroSection`: Contains `HeroCopy` and `SignupFormCard`.
*   `FeatureGrid`: "This is for you".
*   `ValueComparison`: "What you'll get".
*   `FAQSection`: Accordion list.
*   `shared/Section`: Wrapper for standard padding/constraints.

## 7. Tailwind-Ready Class Examples

**Hero H1**:
```tsx
<h1 className="text-slate-900 font-extrabold tracking-tight leading-[1.1] text-[2.5rem] md:text-[4rem]">
  Structure first. <br className="hidden md:block" /> SaaS second.
</h1>
```

**Elevated Form Card**:
```tsx
<div className="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-[0_20px_60px_rgba(15,23,42,0.08)] border border-slate-100">
  {/* content */}
</div>
```

**Primary CTA**:
```tsx
<button className="h-14 w-full rounded-lg bg-indigo-700 hover:bg-indigo-800 text-white font-semibold text-lg transition-all shadow-[0_4px_14px_0_rgba(67,56,202,0.39)] hover:-translate-y-0.5">
  Get the Free PDF
</button>
```

## 8. Example HTML Section Structure

```html
<section class="relative bg-slate-50 py-24">
  <!-- Subtle Grid Background -->
  <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[linear-gradient(...)] opacity-[0.03]"></div>
  
  <div class="container mx-auto px-6 max-w-7xl">
    <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-center">
      <!-- Left Content -->
      <div class="space-y-8">
        <h1 class="...">...</h1>
        <p class="...">...</p>
        <ul class="space-y-4">...</ul>
      </div>
      
      <!-- Right Form -->
      <div class="relative z-10">
        <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-2xl border border-slate-100">
          <form class="space-y-4">
             <!-- Inputs & Button -->
          </form>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
```

## 9. Accessibility Validation Notes
*   **Contrast**: Slate-600 on Slate-50/White passes AA. Indigo-700 on White passes AAA.
*   **Focus States**: Ensure `focus-visible:ring-2 ring-indigo-500 ring-offset-2` is present on all interactive elements.
*   **Semantic HTML**: Use `<main>`, `<section>`, `<h1>` (only one), `<h2>` for sections, `<label>` for inputs.
*   **Motion**: Respect `prefers-reduced-motion` for animations.
